    "result_text": "AcceptanceTest is the only test class, and the full suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe change makes each owner expose `selfLink` = `/api/owners/` + its id. The acceptance test reads it back via `GET /api/owners/{id}`, so the field lives on the owner response DTO.\n\nTwo edits:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a `selfLink` read-only string property to the `Owner` schema (right after `id`). `OwnerDto` is generated from this spec at build time, so this gives the DTO the new field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` for `selfLink` backed by a new `toSelfLink(owner)` default method that returns `\"/api/owners/\" + owner.getId()` (null-safe for an owner without an id yet). Both the create and read responders map through `OwnerMapper`, so the link appears consistently.\n\n`./mvnw test` \u2192 **BUILD SUCCESS**, `AcceptanceTest.coreReturnsSelfLink` passes with all tests green.",
